<% seo title: "Refunds", description: "Blendolo's refund policy: a full refund for an unused Look Pack within 14 days, and the Clinic plan stops at the end of the month you paid for." %>
<div class="page prose">
  <%= render "pages/page_header", chip: "Refunds", title: "Refunds",
        lead: "Short and plain. Last updated 31 October 2026." %>

  <h2>Look Pack</h2>
  <p>If you haven't used any of a pack's credits, you get a full refund when you ask within 14 days of buying it.</p>

  <h2>Clinic plan</h2>
  <p>Cancel any time with "Manage" on your account page. The plan runs to the end of the month you paid for, and the next month isn't charged. We don't refund part of a month.</p>

  <h2>Something went wrong</h2>
  <p>Charged twice, or charged for something that didn't work? Write to us and we'll put it right.</p>

  <h2>How to ask</h2>
  <p>Write to us with the email address you paid with and the date. Dodo Payments, our merchant of record, sends the money back to the card or account you paid with. It can take 5 to 10 business days to reach you.</p>
  <%= render "pages/contact" %>
</div>
